            <ArticleTitle>Multivariate estimation of the relative dose potency.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2187-93</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>As a follow-up to a previous publication we illustrate how multivariate analysis of dose-response trials can be done, providing single number, relative dose potency, results for the comparison between two treatments, also when a number of variables are measured.</AbstractText>
